{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44124","headline":"迷香洞 · 史凤","name":"迷香洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞口飞琼佩羽霓，香风飘拂使人迷。\n自从邂逅芙蓉帐，不数桃花流水溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史凤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}